🧰 Hardware Debouncing: What It Is
Hardware debouncing uses external electrical components to filter out the bounce before the signal even reaches the microcontroller.

🧾 Common hardware debounce methods:
RC (Resistor–Capacitor) Low-Pass Filter

Schmitt Trigger

